{{! Intentionally empty. Every schema in this repository's contracts sets
    additionalProperties: false (strict DTOs) - the stock additional_properties
    partial unconditionally emits Map-implementing accessor methods whenever
    the generator's additionalProperties flag is truthy, without checking
    whether the class was also given `implements Map`/`extends HashMap` via
    `parent`. Under OpenAPI 3.1, that flag is truthy even for
    additionalProperties: false, producing methods that call this.put()/get()
    on a class that isn't a Map - a real bug in openapi-generator's 3.1
    CodegenModel computation, not something a template conditional alone can
    correct. Since this repo never uses genuine free-form additionalProperties,
    the fix mirrors data-fabric's own oas-generator-templates precedent:
    omit the partial's content entirely. }}
